==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Noble Victories|Lampent|59}} from the {{TCG|Noble Victories}} expansion.
*'''Petty Grudge''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Twilight Masquerade|Dreepy|128}} from the {{TCG|Twilight Masquerade}} expansion.
